        {
          "id": 442058127,
          "type": null,
          "body": "@JaapKeuter I get an error with this change.\n```\n../epan/dissectors/packet-rtcp.c:4388:36: error: variable 'padding_item' is uninitialized when used here [-Werror,-Wuninitialized]\n            expert_add_info(pinfo, padding_item, &ei_rtcp_not_final_padding);\n                                   ^~~~~~~~~~~~\n../epan/dissectors/packet-rtcp.c:4347:33: note: initialize the variable 'padding_item' to silence this warning\n        proto_item *padding_item;\n                                ^\n                                 = NULL\n1 error generated.\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/905aafc6b50e246885f5ea9273a9dc4f22e2658b71f9a1b551b797082bec3f80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/stigbjorlykke"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-11-05T07:24:07.309Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-11-05T07:24:07.309Z",
